# Java conventions

Import order: `java.*` / `jakarta.*` → `io.quarkus.*` → third-party → `dev.vepo.engage.*`.

- Formatting: [engage-format-imports.mdc](engage-format-imports.mdc).
- Strings: [engage-strings.mdc](engage-strings.mdc).
- Prefer `var` when obvious; records for API DTOs.
- SLF4J; no API keys in logs.
- Entities in `model/`; `Instant` timestamps.

Domain naming: [domain-model.mdc](domain-model.mdc).
